Third-party material

The skills vendored from other projects keep their own licenses, recorded in
`platforms/kits/third-party/skills.lock` and in each skill directory (`VENDOR.md`, `LICENSE.txt`):
`plugins/architect-core/skills/grilling/` (MIT, mattpocock/skills), `plugins/extras/skills/find-skills/`
(MIT, vercel-labs/skills), `plugins/extras/skills/skill-creator/` and `plugins/extras/skills/frontend-design/`
(Apache-2.0, anthropics/skills). This license does not apply to them and grants no right in them.
